# QF Inteli Terminal — environment variables
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in real values. Never commit
# .env.local or any file containing a real key.

# FRED (Federal Reserve Economic Data) API key — free, no cost.
# Register at: https://fred.stlouisfed.org/docs/api/api_key.html
# Used by: services/macro/fred.ts, services/events/fred-releases.ts
FRED_API_KEY=

# No other keys are required. Market data (Yahoo) and BTC sentiment
# (Alternative.me) use unauthenticated free endpoints — see the doc
# comments in services/market/yahoo.ts and services/sentiment/alternative-me.ts.
